                                "sense_id": "d783b39d-16ad-32a7-9db2-c3a81b6908ea",
                                "text": "If you skip the prelude, which is at once rhythmically square and shapeless, this Lohengrin starts out decently enough, for Hans Helm is one of the okayest Heralds on disc (a modest compliment, to be sure)."
